    1. Generate a 4x4 transpose-symmetric quadrant Q with 3-6 non-zero
       distinct colors; fill the 10 upper-triangle cells, mirror to lower
    2. Build 8x8 panel by reflecting Q into four quadrants
       (UL=Q, UR=Q flipped LR, LL=Q flipped UD, LR=Q flipped both)
    3. Create 12x12 grid of zeros; pick random top-left corner (r,c)
       with r in 0..4, c in 0..4; place 8x8 panel there
    4. Output = Q
